<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             x:Class="TanMenu.Wpf.Views.Settings.FoldersCard">
  <!-- ══ 文件夹 — the ONE tab that keeps group boxes ═════════════════════════════════════════
       ROUND 8, TASK 6 REPLACED THE ROW GRAMMAR everywhere (see AppearanceCard.axaml's header for
       the argument and the published citations), and this file is the exception the rule names.

       WHY THE BOXES STAY HERE AND NOWHERE ELSE. PUBLISHED, ctrl-group-boxes: "Are all the controls
       inside the group? If so, indicate the relationship on the larger surface, such as the parent
       dialog box or page." On 外观, 行为, 常用工具 and 更新 the answer is yes — every control on the
       tab belongs to one set, so the TabItem's own header is the group's name and the box is
       redundant. On this tab it is no: there are FOUR distinct sets — 主文件夹, 数据文件夹, 缓存 and
       备份 — which is the guide's other case, "Is there more than one control in the group?",
       passing. So this tab has four boxes and its TabItem header names the tab, not a group.

       THREE CARDS BECAME FOUR BOXES. 维护 held 清理缓存, 备份… and 恢复… together, which is two sets
       under one heading: clearing the menu cache touches derived data and nothing else, while
       备份/恢复 read and overwrite config.json itself. AppLanguage's Maintenance and
       MaintenanceCardSub are deleted with that card, and Cache / BackupRestore / CacheHelp /
       BackupHelp are new.

       THE BOXES TAKE THE VENDORED THEME'S OWN NUMBERS. Themes/Shell/Launcher.axaml's
       HeaderedContentControl.tm-group-box overrode three of them (CornerRadius 5 -> 3, Padding
       10 -> 11, Margin -> 0,0,0,11) and Task 6 deleted it: three Setters restating what a vendored
       ControlTheme already sets for the same control type are exactly the cosmetic layer this round
       strips. What that rule carried which the theme does not — the gap between one box and the
       next — is the Spacing="11" on the stack below, PUBLISHED as "Between unrelated controls".

       THE PATH LINES ARE VALUE TEXT IN COLUMN 1, opposite a 位置 label in column 0, and they still
       ellipsize with a ToolTip carrying the full path (set in the code-behind). TextTrimming is
       stated locally now because Themes/Shell/Launcher.axaml's TextBlock.tm-card-value went with the
       rest of the row grammar; there is nothing left to restate, and the class's own measurement
       record — that a ~250-character path still ellipsizes rather than inflating the surface — held
       because the dialog's Width is a literal on a CanResize="False" Window, which is still true.

       THE BUTTON STRIPS ARE DOCKED RIGHT ON THE ROW THEY ACT ON, which is both where a Windows 7
       property sheet puts a Browse/Reset strip and what makes this tab fit. Spacing 7 between them is
       PUBLISHED, "Between buttons — 4 / 7"; the 7 to their left is "Between related controls".

       THAT DOCKING IS A MEASURED DECISION, NOT A PREFERENCE. Built first with every strip on a row of
       its own under the content it acts on, this tab measured 577.33 DIP of client height at 711 wide
       (window temporarily switched to SizeToContent="Height", each tab selected through UIA's
       SelectionItemPattern, the window's own UIA BoundingRectangle read after each — Round 8, Task 2's
       method, re-run). The other four measured 246, 350.67, 294.67 and 198. A dialog sized to 577.33
       is 614.67 DIP of OUTER window at this machine's measured 22 x 56 physical px frame, which
       BREAKS the PUBLISHED floor — win-property-win, "Support the minimum Windows Vista screen
       resolution of 800 x 600 pixels". The round's settled ruling for a tab that will not fit is to
       split 文件夹 in two rather than accept a scrollbar; the published sentence itself offers a first
       resort ahead of both — "Don't scroll property pages. Instead of using scrollbars, make the
       property pages larger and lay out the pages efficiently" — and this is that. Docking the four
       strips beside the content they act on takes four rows off the tab. The re-measured height is in
       Dialogs/OptionsWindow.axaml.cs, with the whole table.

       A DockPanel, not a third Grid column: the label-and-value pair inside each folder box stays the
       same "Auto,*" template every other tab uses, so the two 位置 labels still share their x with
       each other and the paths still share theirs, which is the invariant this task is verified on. -->
  <StackPanel Spacing="11" Margin="11">

    <!-- ── 主文件夹 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <HeaderedContentControl Theme="{StaticResource GroupBox}">
      <HeaderedContentControl.Header>
        <TextBlock x:Name="MainFolderHead" Classes="tm-group-head" />
      </HeaderedContentControl.Header>
      <StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="MainFolderHelp" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0">
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="7"
                      VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="7,0,0,0">
            <Button x:Name="OpenRootBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnOpenRootClick" />
            <Button x:Name="PickRootBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnPickRootClick" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" ColumnSpacing="5">
            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" x:Name="RootLocationLabel" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" x:Name="RootPathText" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
          </Grid>
        </DockPanel>
      </StackPanel>
    </HeaderedContentControl>

    <!-- ── 数据文件夹 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <HeaderedContentControl Theme="{StaticResource GroupBox}">
      <HeaderedContentControl.Header>
        <TextBlock x:Name="DataFolderHead" Classes="tm-group-head" />
      </HeaderedContentControl.Header>
      <StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="DataFolderHelp" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0">
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="7"
                      VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="7,0,0,0">
            <Button x:Name="OpenDataBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnOpenDataClick" />
            <Button x:Name="ChangeDataBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnChangeDataClick" />
            <Button x:Name="ResetDataBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnResetDataClick" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" RowDefinitions="Auto,Auto" ColumnSpacing="5">
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" x:Name="DataLocationLabel"
                       VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" x:Name="DataPathText" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                       TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
            <!-- The kind-and-size line carries its own "当前：" prefix, so it needs no label of its
                 own; it sits under the path it describes, at the published 3. It sets NO ToolTip, and
                 that is deliberate: its text is the fixed CurrentDataSize / CurrentDataPending format
                 over one of four short kind literals plus a formatted byte count, so it cannot be
                 trimmed and a ToolTip would only repeat the line already on screen. The two path
                 lines DO set one — they are unbounded user data. -->
            <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" x:Name="DataInfoText" Margin="0,3,0,0" />
          </Grid>
        </DockPanel>
      </StackPanel>
    </HeaderedContentControl>

    <!-- ── 缓存 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <HeaderedContentControl Theme="{StaticResource GroupBox}">
      <HeaderedContentControl.Header>
        <TextBlock x:Name="CacheHead" Classes="tm-group-head" />
      </HeaderedContentControl.Header>
      <DockPanel>
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="7"
                    VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="7,0,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="ClearCacheBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnClearCacheClick" />
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="CacheHelp" TextWrapping="Wrap" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
      </DockPanel>
    </HeaderedContentControl>

    <!-- ── 备份 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <HeaderedContentControl Theme="{StaticResource GroupBox}">
      <HeaderedContentControl.Header>
        <TextBlock x:Name="BackupHead" Classes="tm-group-head" />
      </HeaderedContentControl.Header>
      <DockPanel>
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="7"
                    VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="7,0,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BackupBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnBackupConfigClick" />
          <Button x:Name="RestoreBtn" Theme="{StaticResource TmButton}" Click="OnRestoreConfigClick" />
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="BackupHelp" TextWrapping="Wrap" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
      </DockPanel>
    </HeaderedContentControl>
  </StackPanel>
</UserControl>
